{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>יגודנו</b> — Two times in the Masorah: here and the other: לעלות לעם יגודנו. Meaning: the tribe of Gad took their inheritance across the Jordan, and raiding parties from the surrounding nations would come upon them. This is the meaning of גדוד יגודנו — a raiding party would raid him, but he would turn [them back] on their heel (יגד עקב), for they were mighty and would fight them and turn them back on their heels. And not enough that they turned them back, but they would pursue after them into their land to plunder spoil, and this is לעלות לעם יגודנו — that they would go up against the people who raided them."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:47.333677657Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}